class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 141% of normal in April to May, then fell to 41% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 167% of normal on the middle. Grid 21153 has a preliminary estimate of 42.5 for August to September 2026.</p>"}
